cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use WSPBench, cite this software and record the source commit,
  dataset revision and access condition used in your experiment.
type: software
title: "WSPBench: controlled weight-space programming evaluation"
authors:
  - name: WSPBench contributors
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-11-03"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Independent small-network research preview separating no-tool weight reasoning,
  bounded computational weight analysis, and instrumented diagnosis and repair.
  The public pilot uses dataset revision 0.2.1 and contains eighteen audited
  condition-A development sessions. Public CPU replay regrades saved submissions;
  it does not reproduce proprietary model inference.
keywords:
  - weight-space programming
  - language-model evaluation
  - interpretability
  - benchmark
  - reproducibility
